%d more turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你受到周遭死亡的激励。每夺取一条生命，便获得 %d%% 速度，持续时间再延长 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0fd65a7c46fd568dd6de1e9fb9139524f4029910805869318c2924008cea0f21","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6d9b27003984870ffe547aa7bf1255296606ad1dd26fc46693176c8231eef52","logical_entry_identity":"af4865ff39a27f077bf462f971c9e36c8fe7913e1f18fde4cda29bd45273b689","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#DARK_GREEN#You feel especially blessed.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#DARK_GREEN#你感觉自己被特别祝福了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0a028d249516bf986aea37716cbd16974b7e05b5b5159ed68640b807d45cf06d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6d9f8897ff53790310fdf48e76870be463281bba66570954b5753a07cb84c45","logical_entry_identity":"07b44372de7fa6f80b4252b4c47b54fb5f023ddf1cf00239d8af0ac48082cd0a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"ice storm","source_tag":"damage type","target":"冰风暴"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"79c31fd96d8fedb6f1f0698d99cbf2a668193b525391a7f48bcfc5489b14b07b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6dcf9e1f5c1a07a71ebd569afee8d2788287347b69d2e63e2d92bc74da36b9e","logical_entry_identity":"4f4513922fb7f45d4a9b5ea4c0a38719debf0823f70f53ec3cb9bfa3a91ae53a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Second weapon set: Quiver","source_tag":"_t","target":"第二套武器：箭袋"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"379ad42e52f267ff0773aeaecff5a4e5246f7618e0856a60ec12aff993d2f086","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6dd05e0b51f9c1f669aec9fc79e32854a507f5732097df01e41f808fd8549e6","logical_entry_identity":"11c4cbb4ea85252b50461f7085a6e8270cc43e91650d6087548efc16c6bd913d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of patience","source_tag":"entity name","target":"忍耐之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c19ac871aaab865f82d7b6d206e67e23f7e3294110f8f4cf5d053bac00bd69ca","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6ded8c3069a050c01054615335bb5ba7d5359807d43531ff949a1cd93b5a752","logical_entry_identity":"1fb1033a70fef7e497df487c2a28493aa1f9cdf5a3811af7c211685c54320d6d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"monstrous losgoroth","source_tag":"entity name","target":"大型洛斯格罗斯"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b228be8e0e769752c4fe2a55b53bcb66bdb1c081bfc0d5aa98b937e4ab6a4450","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6e111a3a18ec5cc0950dad5670f848fb3f7e10be1e165b158d14a7635e0c096","logical_entry_identity":"b063d24e37be1454b1f4aebc8d28c9772107eede849ad4aaeca32b5b055cae15","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s(%d deflected)#LAST#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s(%d 敏捷防御)#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b855d829a3685c0aee8ff55b94ae3f8e342cebc1a94b223ad7d17a897049b674","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6e1689660411c7c3fae213da603df2a24e56c8730d36f4c856268970f3aa43b","logical_entry_identity":"e4fc34edb90d52cdb9d81561bc83a7f51c0262ddd38500a69bb703aedd851e1f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Activate the infusion to brighten the area in a radius of %d and illuminate stealthy creatures, possibly revealing them (reduces stealth power by %d).%s\n\t\tIt will also blind any creatures caught inside (power %d) for %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"激活这个纹身照亮半径为 %d 的区域和潜行单位，可能使潜行目标显形（降低 %d 潜行强度）。%s\n\t\t同时，区域内的生物会被致盲（强度 %d），持续 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b7c0c27d60bf3fcfe757854374f05dbfe39295c85df9d2d9176fb006b27b6719","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6e82df22ccf982baca45cc83afe5e47fa98e2a1ae77d619a1d85c090e50ed6b","logical_entry_identity":"0aaa06b5633bf0337dc21d905f81f0b3e1d6ab94b1acaf7fe6e0ca9481669d9d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I have been given permission to explore the scintillating caves to the east. Normally they are sealed off, but having a father on the council has its uses, even if he is normally a dumb buffoon...\n\nThese caves are the site of where the Spellblaze began. An ancient Sher'Tul farportal lay buried here, and our ancestors tapped into that power to their destruction. Many of the greatest Shaloren mages stood here, and when the energies beyond comprehension erupted they were all annihilated instantly. It was a terrible loss to our people - such knowledge and power lost forever!\n\nNow the ancient ruins have become overgrown by crystals. Reports say that they grow each year. Could they be alive..?\n\nI must admit that stepping into the starting place of the Spellblaze fills me with immense trepidation. This was where the great destruction began, that tore through our world, wiping out cities, tearing the world apart. And yet look at the beauty here!\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"我获准探索东面的闪光洞穴。那里通常被严密封锁，不过有个身居长老会的父亲确实很有用——哪怕他平日只是个愚蠢的小丑……\n\n魔法大爆炸正是从这些洞穴开始的。一座夏·图尔时代遗留的远行传送门深埋于此，我们的祖先抽取其中的力量，最终招致自身毁灭。许多最伟大的永恒精灵法师都曾站在这里；超乎理解的能量失控爆发时，他们顷刻间尽数湮灭。这是我族惨痛的损失——那般学识与力量从此永远消逝！\n\n如今，水晶已经爬满了古老废墟。据报告，它们每年都在生长。它们会不会是活的……？\n\n我必须承认，踏入魔法大爆炸的起点，令我心中充满强烈的不安。席卷世界的大毁灭就是从这里开始的：城市被抹去，整个世界遭到撕裂。可是看看这里，多么美丽！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d981e5ac28881ec78ae4be54b93f9a09453e9fe92aa88197f46f57b78af02271","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6e9394375cbe519111c6dbdf1229f75ef3292919928441d2544b8f9f36c095d","logical_entry_identity":"b5745590d5b6a0d1e17cc0c1b938f7eb262706a77595b835ff67019c54dbfbaa","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s<orc summon>#LAST#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s<兽人召唤>#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"681dfb28c7d332ca9b3d3fc92f981e2ce881185e8597fe1324d7205a18965ad4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6e9cd9b73fd68bb78457eced873eeb1df08e0a697f548666eca13b2f0a1c9a1","logical_entry_identity":"e9f0991308858c1cdeda50afcf57f20fbe578662ecaf9d89a5bad557281f1931","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#ORANGE#Magical Status ","source_tag":"_t","target":"#ORANGE#魔法状态"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"77025ca02a44a84c711650e22efa1c5e77cbf68aea232e5cf039730b159a57ef","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6eae8d3af4e8b950b4458502bc97789ad577070d04ea09f8d7f439c58289462","logical_entry_identity":"cdda577fc1147103fbbfc354f0c718a8cc696e3ce6a89ebef6de0a716c2567dd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Work on my glorious project has been delayed. This displeases me. The fools from the nearby village are starting to suspect my presence, and have begun guarding their graveyards and cemeteries closely. Whatever meagre remains I can steal away are often too rotted or insubstantial to use for my project, so I have no choice but to use them as sub-par minions instead. Perhaps they will sow enough conflict and discord so that new, fresher remains will become available...","source_tag":"_t","target":"我伟大的计划被耽搁了。这令我很不悦。\n\t附近村庄里的傻瓜开始怀疑我的存在，严密守卫起他们的坟地和墓园。我能偷走的少量遗骸往往腐烂得太厉害或残缺得无法用于计划，因此只得把它们制成次等仆从。或许这些仆从能制造足够多的冲突和混乱，让我得到更新鲜的遗骸……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2204aab7cdfe578cc83d3445ef5556e30ed829b87c5949734dca52d9964c4fe1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6eb0f492ade8495cb7f3c48c86ccb094e32aefc4bfb83eb08ed04564f72595d","logical_entry_identity":"92d4621a4ff2b94a35403a2c00d5c66f617afbee8c83a8e951f3766a8af64004","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I am pumped up! What's next?","source_tag":"_t","target":"我斗志正旺！下一个是谁？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8c6af37b54c9bc6fabf90001ced3ed1fb2837011faa2e297e05751aee1d2bd72","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6f9c01056769d4ee1c33b21364ce5189614c942cdcba107930cf4ce5c138ce4","logical_entry_identity":"613a36086df18058f0a85951dce036c4ed27039e7d5aa47b9894a8fd0fc30f29","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Some believe that the world is the collective dream of those that live in it.  Find and wake the sleeper and you'll unlock the potential of your dreams.","source_tag":"_t","target":"有些人认为世界由许多个梦境组成，而我们生活在这些梦境里。寻找并唤醒沉睡者，你可以打开通往梦境之门。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e252a123f5df8df64a8671293e1b1d9634d93b08ff6360dccc41088dd92a7b82","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6fb4c117e7651d14e807e4c569c3a2766f6389b21150dddea210bc0f7e1dbc0","logical_en