component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f70924c8810584f83ec3b2601362f887abb73934860a57057f46e8dfc48b5a93","logical_entry_identity":"102318b5933c1e002a3b624ea2e79c0ffe6cf3e8c1ccba23957cd50739c5f3b8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#ORCHID#%s resists the tendrils' pull!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#ORCHID#%s抵抗了触须的抓取！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"21181fd660ff2cff081dbcd884d774afdd182400a051b5b2b495971428be599c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f70a3f03beaac372d830fbb4b7852013fb3ab4c2e3ba2739eeea001ecfa80ad4","logical_entry_identity":"998807e7875c587373325feb8edb84d40a8fbe67c9efa01b79d5e0a76bac369a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Hoarfrost now has additional effects:\n\t\t- if friendly: magical and physical saves increased by %d, at level 5 healing factor is also increased by 15%%.\n\t\t- if hostile: magical and physical saves reduced by %d, at level 5 all talents cool down 15%% slower.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"寒霜覆盖效果获得以下额外效果：\n\t\t- 友方目标：提升 %d 魔法和物理豁免，技能等级 5 时，还会提升治疗系数 15%%。\n\t\t- 敌对目标：降低 %d 魔法和物理豁免，技能等级 5 时，还会使技能冷却时间延长 15%%。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b2a07248ffa9206ace55292f2052632fda8dbe6022744513bc8856e86627edae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f70a62444c3ed798c2a5436ffccc6c882fc413e6aef790a250fc8a52645899b0","logical_entry_identity":"63f1fd40e1155cdebb589b7f9b3dbf69db8460c3cbfa4a68d4f361a13de6cf3c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dreamforge","source_tag":"damage type","target":"梦之熔炉"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b85e755ffa3a0928ad4045383df50031cdec43595f70614f19504c8784ecfcaa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f70a734b4dedd7b6027fb3639738b92921611bb5d738cfefd7e7ddcbb287325e","logical_entry_identity":"103ae92700059f085f00bc8b1227764c00831a6b8c5f7a2268ce50b2518b5677","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Curse","source_tag":"_t","target":"-诅咒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c81120b0bce4be6d9a7e75e7027a8dfe066111996f3000ca67c3e91d4e415ef4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f719dce2077edf481beab66a359c489ac7c5f503128b0deff0590efe0146a1a8","logical_entry_identity":"893ce3f42714e1fa0e14e19b20bc73b7e0ed402f7f365b3d8f6ebd132d23a947","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Earth Master","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"大地领主"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eb664f09bbeea01e7b7b01dc22bfbcf76c3d137b469cd82efdd34577ea94d36e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f71c198a79161bfb27657ac64e0392d0769d0a76d323062dc28842bec53d723c","logical_entry_identity":"56a3786cf96c75ea9a87e1b8560fbf1ef39d52ec150aa8feb3894be305d0a39a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A farportal is a way to travel incredible distances in the blink of an eye. They usually require an external item to use. You have no idea if it is even two-way.\nThis one seems to go near the Gates of Morning in the Far East.","source_tag":"_t","target":"传送门是可以在眨眼间将你传送出很远距离的工具。它们通常需要一件关键道具来激活。你不知道这道门是否为双向的。\n这扇门似乎通向远东的晨曦之门附近。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4a4afbfcd09336ee71f8a6e5e666f901bf7c2c2427f4633aef18cfe72bb008db","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f71c902ca586e26e1d05481ea70a2da18831032ac0194dbd573b97aaeeb15019","logical_entry_identity":"af9e1f74706987bf02d220e763b18e969784d8d573f2a1201208524380af4d2e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Who are the people of Angolwen?","source_tag":"_t","target":"安格利文人是什么人？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f920c549bd02830144d30a6d584616f6fac305c928d5557df9b3884f39a16636","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f71dbbc8786d9185846a737ff48d530d0dee2e6adb034cde06a3311e375563b7","logical_entry_identity":"a849ff1672f67d01e19afb04a1aab09c72c02ed4b3a3a2f817e7ae5e339c3479","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This pulsing, quivering form is a deep crimson, and appears to be composed entirely of thick, virulent blood. Waves rhythmically ripple across its surface, indicating a still beating heart somewhere in its body.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个不断跳动不断颤抖的物体是深红色的，似乎完全由浓厚致命的血液组成。在其表面仍有富有节奏的波纹，也许在其身上的某个地方仍有心脏跳动。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7052454f0d2f1b82107a80c90710940c10ff3e2b0fa204a19cece2ac3c27f295","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f721bda36a399392f941bab754308e15337984915d3c3bc20016bb2f5b5b78ab","logical_entry_identity":"7efbf811b3a917ed4056f283ac3957076c9d26521ce442953ef3aa367e7fe016","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You cannot use %s without a weapon in your inventory!","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"物品栏中没有武器，无法使用 %s！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b0d1d2d69662650cbc0be20e13cd4943e1452356d2f0a660eb89a7e889c42655","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f723cfec5044aaed3dc60ab8a85c2e8be46cd05445d6adaf00826e1c02c6354c","logical_entry_identity":"c3ae517f59f167e9d49cfc48c858beb9a9b2ad4d1ae0a92f913aab9a041cd2ca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Create a gravity field around you that converts %d%% all damage you deal into physical damage, slows incoming projectiles by %d%%, and protects you from all gravity damage and effects.\n\t\tAdditionally, damage dealt by Repulsion Blast has a %d%% chance to reduce the target's knockback resistance by half for two turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在你身边制造一个重力场，将你造成伤害的 %d%% 转化为物理伤害，使向你发射的飞行物减速 %d%%，并使你免受重力伤害和效果的影响。\n\t\t此外，排斥冲击对目标造成伤害之后，有 %d%% 的几率将目标的击退抗性减半两回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c582e172ae22fa31010242e2e69250ae611ff5559bf65fbbd6e772f92584563b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f728062f8227916da21537af7e6d059e6d53a74b9c5511a29a905fab38cc0f8b","logical_entry_identity":"92bb5ca561b1f3df0b3f444992a72eaf352a44eed4b486636b8a33bdb905dbdf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Spit slime at your target doing %0.1f nature damage and slowing it down by 30%% for 3 turns.\n\t\tThe slime can bounce from foe to foe, hitting up to a total of %d target(s).\n\t\tAdditional targets must be within 6 tiles of each other and the slime loses %0.1f%% damage per bounce.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Mindpower","source_tag":"tformat","target":"向目标喷吐粘液，造成 %0.1f 自然伤害，并使其减速 30%%，持续 3 回合。\n\t\t粘液会在敌人之间弹射，最多命中总计 %d 个目标。\n\t\t后续目标彼此之间必须相距不超过 6 格，每次弹射都会损失 %0.1f%% 伤害。\n\t\t伤害随精神强度提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be6686a70785edea08e9d2f492b1755c30fea8ba129ef3765edf6409acaecf71","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f72ac3de1cbba4a5ace7e3e532c6f8df16b4eba09fab16a1d0f942059c8b31c9","logical_entry_identity":"7265328e684f4ef36a4ce42db44c83158600408077e924d128d85d7d5d9fbadc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Cast a net of static electricity in a radius of %d for %d turns.\n\t\tEnemies standing in the net will take %0.1f Lightning damage and be slowed by %d%%.\n\t\tWhen you move through the net, a static charge will accumulate on your weapon which will add %0.1f additional Lightning damage to your next attack for each turn you spend within its area.\n\t\tThese effects scale with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在半径 %d 范围中散布一个持续 %d 回合的静电捕网。\n\t\t站在网中的敌人受到 %0.1f 的闪电伤害并被减速 %d%%。\n\t\t当你在网中穿梭，你的武器上会逐渐累加静电充能，让你的下一次攻击造成额外 %0.1f 的闪电伤害。\n\t\t技能效果受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9df15f864c720e8f13e4bf36aac4671703174e98a207b5169ad89439f841b5be","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f72d028a50fa604aa653758dde7f24dbcdfdcdc3f0d6667ed4650c763264d4ee","logical_entry_identity":"99aca4e182c9b42fe4bdd97eef7216a2f0ecd97e517c94c09cc61f94694abd43","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and hung from the rafters","source_tag":"_t","target":"并被挂在椽子上"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aa0a741156734d5d222238b38a881638e163a2de6b98e0991040aa443429a65e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f72e8928b50b1ca6573d83d2bc46f3ce66c4571c14681d062483a4a5112cf1f2","logical_entry_identity":"1d2e5629e98912e9631b437e7adf0287fcb368a28c12cc33ffdda61d98227328","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Molten Skin","source_tag":"entity name","target":"炽热皮肤"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e535aaf355abdde69ed37